  "_comment": "Eventbrite via the official API v3. The API cannot list a third party's events (public search retired 2019; organization endpoints only serve orgs YOUR token belongs to; /o/ organizer-profile ids are a different id space), so ingestion is: discover event IDS from the public robots-allowed /d/<metro>/all-events/ pages, then hydrate every event through /v3/events/{id}?expand=venue,category under your token - all stored data comes from the API. 'pages' = discovery pages per metro (~20 events each; mind the 2000-calls/hour token quota). 'organizers' below is a curated REFERENCE list (most-active organizers per metro, harvested July 2026) - NOT fetched, since the API can't list them; kept for curation and in case Eventbrite grants org-level access later. include_my_organizations pulls orgs your own token owns via the full API path.",
